  "notes": {
    "sd-five-20261013-note-c8730ce13eae": "Individually classified Public by South Dakota Golf Association; membership or list inclusion alone is not the admission basis. Physical-hole total and course inventory remain unverified; playing-round fees, par and rating tables do not establish physical counts. County, map and arrival are unknown. Bare facts with independently written qualifications only; no website prose, photographs, scorecard artwork or personnel information imported. No explicit open-data license claimed; the facts do not inherit the MIT software license.",
    "sd-five-20261013-note-de9ead3af572": "SDGA profile locality: Murdo, South Dakota. Distinct from Grandpa\u2019s Woods in Murdock, Nebraska. Listed Facebook link was not requested or recorded as an independently found operator website. ",
    "sd-five-20261013-note-58adcc24ed2f": "SDGA profile locality: Mobridge, South Dakota. Website is the operator URL listed by SDGA, not independently visited or verified; website_status remains not_checked and website_checked_on remains null. ",
    "sd-five-20261013-note-713ed22126c6": "SDGA profile locality: Philip, South Dakota. Street and PO Box are combined in the published address; purpose remains unspecified. Held Philip municipal source was not requested and supplies no facts. Listed Facebook link was not requested or recorded as an independently found operator website. ",
    "sd-five-20261013-note-8988bb74fb76": "SDGA profile locality: Spearfish, South Dakota. The live profile has no street address; city/ZIP-only text remains null. Distinct from Elkhorn Ridge Golf Course in Elkhorn, Nebraska. Website is the operator URL listed by SDGA, not independently visited or verified; website_status remains not_checked and website_checked_on remains null. ",
    "sd-five-20261013-history": "Added four net-new individually Public-labeled South Dakota facilities from exactly five authorized SDGA profiles. Bison profile returned500 and was excluded without retry or replacement. Four physical totals remain null and inventories empty; no county/map/arrival/course additions or playing-round inference. Source controls, policy and pacing evidence retained in research/south-dakota-five-20261013."
